{'symbol': 'UNP', 'date': '2022-05-31 08:00:00', 'title': 'UNION PACIFIC CORPORATION EXECUTIVES TO ADDRESS THE UBS GLOBAL INDUSTRIALS AND TRANSPORTATION CONFERENCE', 'text': 'OMAHA, NEB. , MAY 31, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- JENNIFER HAMANN, EXECUTIVE VICE PRESIDENT AND CHIEF FINANCIAL OFFICER, AND KENNY ROCKER, EXECUTIVE VICE PRESIDENT – MARKETING AND SALES, OF UNION PACIFIC CORPORATION (NYSE: UNP), WILL ADDRESS THE UBS GLOBAL INDUSTRIALS AND TRANSPORTATION CONFERENCE ON TUESDAY, JUNE 7, 2022, AT 8:00 A.M.'}